    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/de77b6c6b41d399988142066c68d8626.avif?t=1705293765\" width=616 height=372 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Dagger Run: Aerocombatic Racing</strong> </h2> is a hybrid of fast-paced flight racing and first person exploration. Inhabit the role of a rookie pilot as they race their way through strange and wonderful worlds to become the champion of the Dagger Run.<br><br>Experience an adventure in the stars as Zef, a stargazer who dreams of leaving her planet to compete in the thrilling sport of Aerocombatic racing. But life on the junk planet of Aephesta is hard to escape and Zef has nothing but her resourcefulness and her friends to help her on her way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Dagger</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/a4b7bfa3fbc3e874bde44d644aafa4dc.poster.avif?t=1705293765\" width=558 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/a4b7bfa3fbc3e874bde44d644aafa4dc.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/a4b7bfa3fbc3e874bde44d644aafa4dc.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your vehicle is the Dagger, an antigravity vehicle that is a mix of a formula one car and a fighter jet. Fly through the skies, narrow passages or even tunnels straight down through the ground.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready Set Go</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/0145950bf26a5af18737ed3f2fccc771.poster.avif?t=1705293765\" width=558 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/0145950bf26a5af18737ed3f2fccc771.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/0145950bf26a5af18737ed3f2fccc771.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Race through courses on several strange and varied planets. Each planet is unique and offers a new challenge. Maybe you are racing through tunnels in the ocean of a water world or through the clouds of a gas giant, or maybe around a space station in the stars themselves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your edge</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/29cafb1bc12fb98700d7b4e4ff667da1.poster.avif?t=1705293765\" width=558 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/29cafb1bc12fb98700d7b4e4ff667da1.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/29cafb1bc12fb98700d7b4e4ff667da1.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step out of the cockpit to explore hubs on each planet. Search out shops or junkyards to find parts or weapons to give your Dagger the edge in your next race.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut through the competition</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/767bf2622fdd0db62d0390aa780e9b19.poster.avif?t=1705293765\" width=558 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/767bf2622fdd0db62d0390aa780e9b19.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/767bf2622fdd0db62d0390aa780e9b19.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use your arsenal of weapons to take out your opponents",
