.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/0145950bf26a5af18737ed3f2fccc771.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/0145950bf26a5af18737ed3f2fccc771.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Race through courses on several strange and varied planets. Each planet is unique and offers a new challenge. Maybe you are racing through tunnels in the ocean of a water world or through the clouds of a gas giant, or maybe around a space station in the stars themselves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your edge</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/29cafb1bc12fb98700d7b4e4ff667da1.poster.avif?t=1705293765\" width=558 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/29cafb1bc12fb98700d7b4e4ff667da1.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/29cafb1bc12fb98700d7b4e4ff667da1.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step out of the cockpit to explore hubs on each planet. Search out shops or junkyards to find parts or weapons to give your Dagger the edge in your next race.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut through the competition</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/767bf2622fdd0db62d0390aa780e9b19.poster.avif?t=1705293765\" width=558 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/767bf2622fdd0db62d0390aa780e9b19.webm?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613990/extras/767bf2622fdd0db62d0390aa780e9b19.mp4?t=1705293765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use your arsenal of weapons to take out your opponents",
